WEBVTT

00:08.842 --> 00:16.883
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.883 --> 00:24.881
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.399 --> 00:36.202
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.202 --> 00:39.205
Believing, dreaming

00:39.205 --> 00:43.043
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.043 --> 00:48.174
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.983 --> 00:58.391
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.391 --> 01:02.962
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.962 --> 01:05.632
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.632 --> 01:13.907
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.907 --> 01:18.867
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.413 --> 01:27.046
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:34.327 --> 01:38.431
Jeez. You're into some pretty
worthless stuff, aren't ya?

01:38.431 --> 01:41.889
You'll just be bored of the thing
in a week, anyway.

01:42.535 --> 01:43.803
I think not!

01:43.803 --> 01:47.534
This "Sparkling Prince" I bought through
mail order is most useful!

01:48.374 --> 01:49.876
Oh really?

01:49.876 --> 01:52.174
Still, it's too bad...

01:53.146 --> 01:57.014
All that evil energy we'd collected,
gone in an instant.

02:03.289 --> 02:06.593
It was so hard just to collect what we did.

02:06.593 --> 02:09.221
So what? We'll just do it again.

02:11.331 --> 02:13.099
We have plenty of time.

02:13.099 --> 02:14.234
Master Loki!

02:14.234 --> 02:15.360
Daddy!

02:16.903 --> 02:20.106
If we light those candlesticks
with evil energy,

02:20.106 --> 02:22.275
I can go back to my original form.

02:22.275 --> 02:24.243
And return to the world of the gods.

02:25.378 --> 02:30.145
There is no longer a place for you
in the world of the gods.

02:33.186 --> 02:34.676
Daddy, what's that?

02:35.021 --> 02:36.716
What is it, brother?

02:41.661 --> 02:42.929
It's...

02:42.929 --> 02:44.453
A fragment of evil energy.

02:45.064 --> 02:47.328
So there was one little piece left.

02:47.834 --> 02:49.802
I guess I'll hold onto it as a keepsake.

02:51.070 --> 02:52.367
Keepsake?

02:52.805 --> 02:55.672
The lucky fragment that remained
until the very end.

02:56.242 --> 02:58.710
I'm sure it's of the choicest evil.

02:59.512 --> 03:05.178
The 18th Night
The Multi-Faceted Detective Appears?!

03:05.852 --> 03:09.811
Our plans to destroy Lord Loki
have repeatedly failed.

03:10.557 --> 03:14.357
You two have performed quite poorly.

03:14.861 --> 03:18.228
I don't know how I should inform Lord Odin.

03:19.999 --> 03:22.695
Our plans were perfect.

03:23.303 --> 03:26.973
What ruined them was the addition
of indeterminate elements

03:26.973 --> 03:28.873
that we hadn't counted on.

03:29.709 --> 03:32.678
It appears I have no choice but
to intervene personally.

03:43.890 --> 03:46.358
Nothing today either, huh?

03:47.293 --> 03:51.127
Won't we get any exciting case requests?

03:58.037 --> 03:59.973
Loki! A case!

03:59.973 --> 04:02.407
We've got a new case request!

04:03.443 --> 04:08.481
People are hearing laughter coming from
an abandoned house every night.

04:08.481 --> 04:12.585
The laughter is very frightening;
those who hear it even once

04:12.585 --> 04:16.289
can't get it out of their heads,
and can't even sleep at night!

04:16.289 --> 04:18.825
We would definitely like you to
find out what's behind this.

04:18.825 --> 04:20.452
We're counting on you.

04:27.800 --> 04:30.937
It kinda feels like this is going
to be a strange mystery!

04:30.937 --> 04:35.169
According to the letter, this is where we're
supposed to meet our client, right?

04:36.009 --> 04:38.409
Maybe they're in another room.

04:41.781 --> 04:42.907
There it is!

04:43.750 --> 04:45.217
Daddy! Over there!

04:49.889 --> 04:50.890
Yamino...

04:50.890 --> 04:52.414
Uh, right!

05:06.906 --> 05:09.704
Laugh

05:14.380 --> 05:16.049
A laughing bag?

05:16.049 --> 05:19.052
How cruel! Someone played a trick on us!

05:19.052 --> 05:21.247
What are you doing, Master Loki?

05:22.722 --> 05:25.520
I was just wondering if there
are any clues about.

05:26.626 --> 05:29.527
You're not going to find anything, Daddy.

05:30.596 --> 05:32.498
It was just a prank.

05:32.498 --> 05:34.467
Let's go back and have some tea.

05:34.467 --> 05:38.571
If this had really been just a hoax,
I wouldn't have come here in the first place.

05:38.571 --> 05:39.435
Huh?

05:40.606 --> 05:44.975
The letter we received had a
faint touch of evil to it.

05:45.578 --> 05:49.014
From the guardians of fate
To the little giant

05:51.150 --> 05:53.118
Hey, Loki! Come check this out!

05:53.419 --> 05:54.386
Mayura!

05:54.620 --> 05:55.955
Wow, it's so pretty!

05:55.955 --> 05:56.622
Don't touch that!
Wow, it's so pretty!

05:56.622 --> 05:57.281
Don't touch that!

06:07.900 --> 06:10.403
Oh, it broke.

06:10.403 --> 06:12.633
Master Loki! Are you hurt?

06:14.107 --> 06:16.007
No. I'm all right.

06:37.997 --> 06:39.565
I'm home, Ecchan.

06:39.565 --> 06:40.900
Who's Ecchan?

06:40.900 --> 06:44.303
Oh, it's nothing! Don't mind him.

06:44.303 --> 06:47.363
Loki says some strange things
sometimes, doesn't he?

06:48.674 --> 06:50.642
Not as often as you do, Mayura.

06:56.916 --> 07:00.987
What a day! Talk about all pain and no gain!

07:00.987 --> 07:01.988
Punyan!

07:01.988 --> 07:04.657
You said it. "Punyan," indeed.

07:04.657 --> 07:06.426
I couldn't have put it better my...

07:06.426 --> 07:07.586
"Punyan"?

07:08.060 --> 07:10.563
Punyan! Punyan?

07:10.563 --> 07:12.030
Punyan punyan.

07:14.100 --> 07:15.501
What's the matter, Loki?

07:15.501 --> 07:18.070
What's wrong, Master Loki?

07:18.070 --> 07:20.072
Punyan punyaaan.

07:20.072 --> 07:22.131
Loki's gone bananas!

07:25.745 --> 07:27.580
Was I saying something?

07:27.580 --> 07:32.017
Were you saying something?
You were all, "punyan, punyan"!

07:33.653 --> 07:36.247
You must be tired, Daddy!

07:39.826 --> 07:43.353
No, I'm not!
I'm always shiny bright as can be!

07:44.464 --> 07:48.161
Master Loki is always cool, but now
he's being sweet and playful!

07:48.668 --> 07:52.171
Crap, this cute act really makes
my shoulders sore!

07:52.171 --> 07:54.696
Hey! Rub my shoulders, will ya?

07:55.274 --> 07:57.343
What's the matter with you, Master Loki?

07:57.343 --> 08:00.813
You're acting rather two-faced,
like big brother.

08:00.813 --> 08:04.874
Bastard! Who the hell are
you callin' two-faced?!

08:07.220 --> 08:08.517
Daddy?

08:08.721 --> 08:10.723
We were just joking around right now.

08:10.723 --> 08:14.989
You know I'd never really use
such harsh language, right?

08:15.261 --> 08:17.530
You're acting kinda weird, Loki.

08:17.530 --> 08:19.623
Do you have a fever or something?

08:22.668 --> 08:24.003
I sure do!

08:24.003 --> 08:27.302
I'm always fired up for a mystery!

08:27.740 --> 08:28.941
"Fired up"?

08:28.941 --> 08:30.067
Daddy...

08:31.377 --> 08:35.047
So you like mysteries?

08:35.047 --> 08:37.116
Well, of course I do!

08:37.116 --> 08:41.387
The only thing better than three meals
a day and snacks is a good mystery!

08:41.387 --> 08:43.389
Is that right?!

08:43.389 --> 08:48.160
You always play it so cool, so I didn't
think you were interested.

08:48.160 --> 08:51.664
But the truth is you're a
mystery lover, aren't you?

08:51.664 --> 08:52.999
Naturally!

08:52.999 --> 08:54.233
One, two...

08:54.233 --> 08:55.996
Another strange mystery!

08:56.836 --> 08:59.600
Daddy, what on Earth has happened to you?

08:59.939 --> 09:06.045
Could it be that Master Loki is absorbing the
personalities of people who are near him?

09:06.045 --> 09:08.881
What? Is that even possible?!

09:08.881 --> 09:13.181
I've heard there's a kind of curse
that can do that.

09:16.656 --> 09:18.351
Could that have been when it happened?

09:18.991 --> 09:21.327
Excellent work, Urd!

09:21.327 --> 09:24.626
A personality-transference curse was
such an interesting choice!

09:25.932 --> 09:28.400
Things are just going to get more interesting.

09:34.206 --> 09:35.641
Let's see here...

09:35.641 --> 09:38.711
Curses, being cursed, demeanor, dispelling...

09:38.711 --> 09:40.338
Ah, here it is!

09:40.613 --> 09:42.348
Personality-transference curse.

09:42.348 --> 09:46.852
The victim's personality is overridden by
that of anyone in close proximity to him.

09:46.852 --> 09:49.155
What?! That's a pretty frickin' big deal!

09:49.155 --> 09:51.157
How do we break the curse?

09:51.157 --> 09:53.648
It doesn't say.

09:54.093 --> 09:55.595
What should we do?

09:55.595 --> 09:58.264
Don't "what should we do" me, ya nitwit!

09:58.264 --> 10:01.200
What if our old man gets stuck with
some crazy stupid personality?!

10:01.200 --> 10:03.235
I know, but...

10:03.235 --> 10:05.905
In any case, until we find a way
to break the curse,

10:05.905 --> 10:09.602
we need to keep Master Loki
away from other people.

10:11.410 --> 10:13.245
Where is Master Loki?

10:13.245 --> 10:14.075
Daddy!

10:14.513 --> 10:17.812
Okay, Loki, it's time for a
strange mystery showdown!

10:18.150 --> 10:21.449
Whoever finds more mysteries wins, right?

10:21.754 --> 10:21.887
Ready, set...

10:21.887 --> 10:22.722
Mystery
Challenge

10:22.722 --> 10:23.211
Ready, set...

10:23.489 --> 10:24.557
Bang!

10:24.557 --> 10:26.889
Hey! No fair, Loki!

10:45.344 --> 10:47.813
You're, like, so cute!

10:47.813 --> 10:51.050
Oh, don't say that!
I'm, like, getting embarrassed!

10:51.050 --> 10:52.142
Master Loki!

10:52.618 --> 10:55.621
You! Please get away from Master Loki!

10:55.621 --> 10:57.248
Who the heck are you?

11:02.728 --> 11:04.797
We've been searching all over
for you, Master Loki.

11:04.797 --> 11:07.061
You had us worried, Daddy!

11:08.768 --> 11:10.202
What am I...

11:10.202 --> 11:13.171
For now, let's just go someplace
where there are no people.

11:13.706 --> 11:14.940
Come on now, hurry.

11:14.940 --> 11:17.009
It's hopeless, isn't it?

11:17.009 --> 11:18.711
I'm just like these ants.

11:18.711 --> 11:24.013
I spend my life running around
the place, working hard.

11:24.283 --> 11:27.150
The ants probably have it better off.

11:27.586 --> 11:30.389
At work, my bosses yell at me.

11:30.389 --> 11:33.552
At home, my wife is mean to me.

11:33.959 --> 11:35.695
I'd rather...

11:35.695 --> 11:37.890
just be an ant.

11:38.264 --> 11:40.066
Stop it, Master Loki!

11:40.066 --> 11:42.534
Please have some more hope for your life!

11:44.503 --> 11:44.570
Electric
Filleting Machine!

11:44.570 --> 11:46.936
Electric
Filleting Machine!
Buy, buy, buy! They're goin' cheap!

11:47.239 --> 11:51.377
I've always wanted one of those electric filleting
machines that guy over there is selling!

11:51.377 --> 11:55.677
With that, I'd be able to fillet
any kind of fish in seconds!

11:55.948 --> 11:59.185
But that was only supposed to be
available through mail order.

11:59.185 --> 12:01.346
They're selling them here?!

12:03.489 --> 12:05.591
What are you doing, big brother?!

12:05.591 --> 12:10.262
Jeez! You touched Loki, so he's
absorbed your personality!

12:10.262 --> 12:11.695
Ya frickin' moron!

12:12.832 --> 12:16.502
If I used that to fillet some fresh mackerel,

12:16.502 --> 12:20.700
I could make the most delicious fish dish ever!

12:22.742 --> 12:25.177
Anyway, let's get back to
the detective agency

12:25.177 --> 12:27.680
before you come in contact
with any more people.

12:27.680 --> 12:29.307
Hey there! If it isn't Loki!

12:30.249 --> 12:33.878
I just bought some pork croquettes.

12:34.386 --> 12:35.580
Oh, no!

12:37.523 --> 12:42.795
Those are the fresh-fried croquettes that
the butcher on 3rd Street makes

12:42.795 --> 12:45.662
with a lavish helping of
farm-fresh black pork!

12:45.865 --> 12:48.663
Daddy! Don't go near him!

12:51.137 --> 12:52.604
Gimme one of those!

12:58.978 --> 13:01.947
Croquettes really do taste best
straight out of the fryer!

13:02.748 --> 13:06.377
I just wish I'd gotten him to
put more sauce on these.

13:06.886 --> 13:10.014
Loki, you rat! How dare you
steal my croquettes?!

13:10.389 --> 13:11.686
Daddy...

13:15.294 --> 13:18.991
I wonder if there are any interesting
mysteries around here.

13:23.102 --> 13:25.104
There you are, my Japanese beauty!

13:25.104 --> 13:27.173
It is fate that has brought us together here!

13:27.173 --> 13:30.042
Today is the day I will make
my feelings known!

13:30.042 --> 13:32.033
Come to me, Gullinbursti!

13:37.183 --> 13:39.151
Now, away!

13:41.253 --> 13:42.447
Oh, dear.

13:46.926 --> 13:48.460
Master Loki!

13:48.460 --> 13:49.829
Pops.

13:49.829 --> 13:51.956
Hey. What are you doing?

13:53.365 --> 13:56.335
Looks like a lot of fun there, Frey.

13:56.335 --> 13:58.826
Playing horsie with my old
enemy Loki, are you?

13:59.872 --> 14:02.841
Why do we keep running into these
people now of all times?

14:03.275 --> 14:05.177
What do you think you're doing, Loki?

14:05.177 --> 14:07.805
Are you trying to draw Frey into
your little circle of friends?

14:09.081 --> 14:12.380
You think I'd make friends
with the likes of you?

14:12.718 --> 14:17.178
I want to see you both in pain,
writhing in agony.

14:21.460 --> 14:25.264
Is that right? Well, I think
that'll be all for today.

14:25.264 --> 14:26.599
We're outta here, Frey!

14:26.599 --> 14:29.659
Curses! I lost track of my Japanese beauty!

14:30.035 --> 14:32.026
After her, Gullinbursti!

14:35.040 --> 14:39.773
What happened to him?
He's creepin' me out.

14:40.145 --> 14:42.943
All the undesirables are finally gone.

14:43.382 --> 14:45.782
Go back to normal, Daddy!

14:46.185 --> 14:48.653
Huh? Why am I...

14:48.921 --> 14:51.857
Have you returned to normal, Master Loki?

14:51.857 --> 14:54.087
Master Loki? Who's that?

14:55.928 --> 14:56.829
Master Loki!

14:56.829 --> 14:57.625
Daddy!

14:58.430 --> 15:00.990
"Daddy"? Who are you?

15:03.469 --> 15:06.768
We're finally getting some results.

15:07.907 --> 15:13.140
The personality-transference curse makes its
victims mirror the personalities of others.

15:13.646 --> 15:21.280
And each time the victim changes personalities,
bit by bit, he loses his own identity.

15:21.687 --> 15:27.819
So if Loki is no longer himself,
he won't be our enemy anymore, right?

15:28.193 --> 15:31.026
You're so very shrewd, Urd.

15:42.508 --> 15:45.044
The detective agency's a little bit farther.

15:45.044 --> 15:48.647
If we could just make it without
running into anyone else.

15:48.647 --> 15:50.316
Hey there! It's Loki!

15:50.316 --> 15:51.078
What?!

15:52.117 --> 15:53.584
Kebabs

15:53.919 --> 15:56.080
Come eat some kebabs! They're good!

15:56.488 --> 15:59.821
Narugami, what are you doing here?

15:59.892 --> 16:00.125
Kebabs

16:00.125 --> 16:01.560
Kebabs
What's the big deal, Four-Eyes?

16:01.560 --> 16:04.324
Kebabs
I heard that! What, is this a bad time
for you to be seeing me?

16:04.630 --> 16:06.765
Well, no, it's not like that.

16:06.765 --> 16:09.335
You're just sort of in our way, so...

16:09.335 --> 16:10.836
What was that?!

16:10.836 --> 16:13.405
In all of my long and hard hours
of part-time work,

16:13.405 --> 16:17.209
I do not remember ever encountering
a customer who tried to avoid me!

16:17.209 --> 16:20.838
I'm telling you it's not like that.

16:21.180 --> 16:22.514
That's right!

16:22.514 --> 16:24.683
It's a cardinal rule of the
professional part-timer!

16:24.683 --> 16:27.481
The customer must always receive
service with a smile!

16:28.187 --> 16:29.313
Huh?!

16:29.755 --> 16:31.023
Master Loki!

16:31.023 --> 16:34.927
Whoa, Loki! So you finally understand
the trouble I go through!

16:34.927 --> 16:36.395
Hello.

16:36.395 --> 16:37.692
Welcome!

16:38.030 --> 16:40.931
Are you working today too, Loki?

16:41.200 --> 16:44.169
As part of our daily special,
this one's on me!

16:44.770 --> 16:46.931
Not Reiya too!

16:47.406 --> 16:49.374
Here you go. Eat it all up!

16:50.743 --> 16:52.108
Thank you!

16:57.182 --> 16:59.251
Master Loki! Let's go home!

16:59.251 --> 17:00.115
Daddy!

17:02.788 --> 17:05.224
Where am I?

17:05.224 --> 17:07.089
Who am I?

17:12.398 --> 17:13.888
What was that?!

17:17.703 --> 17:18.863
Reiya!

17:21.240 --> 17:22.366
The Norns?

17:26.211 --> 17:27.980
You're too late.

17:27.980 --> 17:31.313
Lord Loki can no longer remember who he is.

17:35.354 --> 17:38.791
And now that he no longer knows
he is the god of evil,

17:38.791 --> 17:41.419
he will vanish without resistance.

17:43.262 --> 17:44.889
Okay, come out!

17:55.474 --> 17:56.771
Get them!

17:59.211 --> 18:00.041
Master Loki!

18:00.179 --> 18:00.804
Daddy!

18:17.529 --> 18:18.655
What?!

18:19.164 --> 18:23.123
Do you scum think your power
is a match for my own?

18:23.435 --> 18:25.403
That's... It couldn't be!

18:25.704 --> 18:27.934
Midgardsormr's personality!

18:39.551 --> 18:41.644
Now he's got Fenrir's personality!

18:41.987 --> 18:44.785
Not bad, Loki! I'll back you up!

18:45.591 --> 18:47.559
Roar, Mjolnir!

18:47.793 --> 18:49.454
This is payback for my kebab stand!

18:53.966 --> 18:55.524
Laevateinn!

19:01.673 --> 19:03.208
Why?!

19:03.208 --> 19:08.313
Shouldn't Lord Loki have lost his power
along with his personality?!

19:08.313 --> 19:11.908
Loki has indeed lost his personality.

19:12.351 --> 19:18.221
However, he is currently possessed by
personalities not inferior to his own.

19:24.796 --> 19:25.956
How careless of me!

19:34.573 --> 19:36.141
That's the fragment of evil power!

19:36.141 --> 19:37.809
It's thanks to that thing!

19:37.809 --> 19:40.179
The fight's not over yet!

19:40.179 --> 19:42.409
Give him all you've got!

19:51.657 --> 19:55.616
The evil energy protected your
true self, didn't it?

19:58.730 --> 20:00.459
Veil lubadrock!

20:08.574 --> 20:09.598
Cuerios!

20:18.483 --> 20:20.007
Still want to fight?

20:28.627 --> 20:29.594
Master Loki.

20:30.662 --> 20:32.186
How's Reiya doing?

20:32.764 --> 20:36.165
She's all right. She's just unconscious.

20:42.307 --> 20:46.107
Looks like such a small amount of energy
was only good for a moment.

20:47.246 --> 20:50.147
The important thing is that
you're all right.

20:50.716 --> 20:54.553
I think you're best just the way
you always are, Daddy!

20:54.553 --> 20:56.316
Thanks, Fenrir.

20:59.091 --> 21:01.321
It looks like there's still a little left.

21:02.394 --> 21:04.021
I'll give it to you, Ecchan.

21:04.496 --> 21:05.463
Ouch!

21:08.400 --> 21:10.135
Thankoo, Master Loki!

21:10.135 --> 21:12.069
Ecchan spoke!

21:12.504 --> 21:13.903
A little improvement, huh?

21:15.140 --> 21:17.643
It's the strange mystery showdown!

21:17.643 --> 21:19.838
And now, announcing the results!

21:19.978 --> 21:22.469
I found this many of 'em!

21:23.815 --> 21:25.751
This here's the best one!

21:25.751 --> 21:27.853
There's a rumor that at 3:00 a.m.
On the morning of March 3rd,

21:27.853 --> 21:30.789
if you run into a three-colored cat
while walking on 3rd Street,

21:30.789 --> 21:32.916
it will lead you to the River Styx!

21:33.091 --> 21:35.321
You love this kind of stuff, right, Loki?!

21:37.262 --> 21:38.559
Not really.

21:41.333 --> 21:44.791
It seems we'll need to alter
our strategy, won't we?

21:45.570 --> 21:49.097
I thought we could finish this by
going after Lord Loki alone, but...

21:49.541 --> 21:53.445
You're right. To take out Loki
once and for all,

21:53.445 --> 21:57.973
we'll first have to exterminate
all those around him, won't we?

22:16.935 --> 22:28.904
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

